# BEAT 31 — /wake-help: every key and command, read from the build, in the pane
# it was typed in. Typing narrows it; esc closes it.
Output .work/out/31-wake-help.mp4
Source .work/head.tape
Hide
Source .work/stage.tape
Show
Sleep 1500ms
Type "/wake-help"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3500ms
PageDown
Sleep 2500ms
Type "park"
Sleep 3500ms
Backspace 4
Sleep 800ms
Type "channel"
Sleep 3500ms
Escape
Sleep 2s
